*> PLB-Q026 cursor-table-mismatch: an UPDATE or DELETE WHERE CURRENT
*> OF a cursor declared on another table.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CURTABLE.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-ID               PIC S9(9) COMP.
    EXEC SQL
        DECLARE ACCT-CUR CURSOR FOR
            SELECT ACCT_ID FROM BANK.ACCOUNT FOR UPDATE
    END-EXEC.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    EXEC SQL OPEN ACCT-CUR END-EXEC
    EXEC SQL FETCH ACCT-CUR INTO :WS-ID END-EXEC
    *> Reported: the cursor is on ACCOUNT.
    EXEC SQL
        DELETE FROM HISTORY WHERE CURRENT OF ACCT-CUR
    END-EXEC
    *> Not reported: its own table, with or without the qualifier.
    EXEC SQL
        UPDATE BANK.ACCOUNT SET ACCT_ID = :WS-ID
         WHERE CURRENT OF ACCT-CUR
    END-EXEC
    EXEC SQL
        DELETE FROM ACCOUNT WHERE CURRENT OF ACCT-CUR
    END-EXEC
    EXEC SQL CLOSE ACCT-CUR END-EXEC
    STOP RUN.
